    {"id": "a2-capb", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 920, "width": 340, "height": 66, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["A2", "lane1"], "seed": 1216, "text": "Unchanged except where the price comes from: store.price()\nbecomes the catalog's monthPrice. The tiers stay app\nresources - BadgeLevel already holds the titles and the file\nsizes - so the catalog only prices them, and a level with no\nactive price is the disabled card this screen can already\ndraw.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a03f"},

