    {"id": "b2-note", "type": "text", "x": 504, "y": 1336, "width": 252, "height": 26, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2207, "text": "Charged by the App Store to the\naccount on this device.", "fontSize": 9.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a126"},
    {"id": "b2-btn", "type": "rectangle", "x": 510, "y": 1590, "width": 240, "height": 38, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#5b21b6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2208, "boundElements": [{"id": "b2-btnt", "type": "text"}], "index": "a127"},
    {"id": "b2-btnt", "type": "text", "x": 520, "y": 1602, "width": 220, "height": 14, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2209, "text": "Pay $699.99/year", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "b2-btn", "index": "a128"},
    {"id": "b2-sec", "type": "text", "x": 500, "y": 1646, "width": 260, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#5b21b6", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2210, "text": "Pay in the browser for 1 year", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a129"},
    {"id": "b2-foot", "type": "text", "x": 500, "y": 1676, "width": 260, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2211, "text": "Renews on 24 August 2027. Cancel anytime.", "fontSize": 9.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a12a"},
    {"id": "b2-capt", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 1790, "width": 300, "height": 14, "strokeColor": "#5b21b6", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2212, "text": "B2.  New screen, where the browser is allowed", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a12b"},
    {"id": "b2-capb", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 1810, "width": 340, "height": 66, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["B2", "lane2"], "seed": 2213, "text": "The second button names the term, not a price: a store build\nhas no catalog, so it cannot know what the browser will\ncharge - and it will not be $699.99. Annual reads 1 year,\nMonthly reads 1 month; the browser sells prepaid months, so\nthe renewal simply does not travel. Gated as the Wefunder\nbanner is: isInUS on iOS, crowdfundingAvailable() on Kotlin.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a12c"},

