    {"id": "c2-status", "type": "text", "x": 496, "y": 2306, "width": 268, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#0053d0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C2", "lane3"], "seed": 3210, "text": "o  Waiting for the payment to confirm", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a229"},
    {"id": "c2-muted", "type": "text", "x": 496, "y": 2334, "width": 268, "height": 24, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C2", "lane3"], "seed": 3211, "text": "Bookmark this page - the address and the\ncountdown both live on this URL.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a22a"},
    {"id": "c2-cancel", "type": "text", "x": 496, "y": 2380, "width": 268, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#b03030", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C2", "lane3"], "seed": 3212, "text": "Cancel this invoice", "fontSize": 9.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a22b"},
    {"id": "c2-capt", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 2680, "width": 300, "height": 14, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C2", "lane3"], "seed": 3213, "text": "C2.  Unchanged", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a22c"},
    {"id": "c2-capb", "type": "text", "x": 480, "y": 2700, "width": 340, "height": 66, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C2", "lane3"], "seed": 3214, "text": "It already resumes an order from the server, so an invoice the\napp created needs nothing new here. Card is not a hosted\npage - the invoice carries a Stripe client_secret and the page\nrenders Elements - which is the reason no card form can\nmove into the app, whatever else does.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a22d"},

