    {"id": "c3-urlt", "type": "text", "x": 916, "y": 2048, "width": 268, "height": 12, "strokeColor": "#9aa1ab", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3303, "text": "badges.simplex.chat/?order=8f3a...", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a232"},
    {"id": "c3-title", "type": "text", "x": 916, "y": 2090, "width": 268, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3304, "text": "Payment received", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a233"},
    {"id": "c3-lede", "type": "text", "x": 916, "y": 2124, "width": 268, "height": 26, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3305, "text": "Your badge is being issued in SimpleX.\nYou can close this page.", "fontSize": 9.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a234"},
    {"id": "c3-notice", "type": "rectangle", "x": 916, "y": 2166, "width": 268, "height": 54, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#f2f4f7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3306, "index": "a235"},
    {"id": "c3-noticet", "type": "text", "x": 928, "y": 2178, "width": 244, "height": 36, "strokeColor": "#4b5563", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3307, "text": "Still processing\nMonero payments confirm in a couple\nof minutes. Nothing more is needed here.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a236"},
    {"id": "c3-field", "type": "text", "x": 916, "y": 2238, "width": 268, "height": 24, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3308, "text": "REFERENCE\n8f3a-2c19-4b77", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": false, "index": "a237"},
    {"id": "c3-btn", "type": "rectangle", "x": 916, "y": 2290, "width": 268, "height": 38, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#0053d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3309, "boundElements": [{"id": "c3-btnt", "type": "text"}], "index": "a238"},
    {"id": "c3-btnt", "type": "text", "x": 926, "y": 2302, "width": 248, "height": 14, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3310, "text": "Return to SimpleX", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "c3-btn", "index": "a239"},
    {"id": "c3-capt", "type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 2680, "width": 300, "height": 14, "strokeColor": "#0053d0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3311, "text": "C3.  The one new page state", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a23a"},
    {"id": "c3-capb", "type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 2700, "width": 340, "height": 66, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["C3", "lane3"], "seed": 3312, "text": "Today a settled invoice shows a code; here there is none, and\ncodeIssued would land on 'This code is not on this device'.\nThe button is a courtesy: the badge is granted over SMP\nwhether or not anyone comes back, and a payment made on\nanother device never comes back at all. So the deep link may\naccelerate A5 - it may never be its proof.", "fontSize": 9, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a23b"},

    {"id": "ar-c1c2", "type": "arrow", "x": 368, "y": 2350, "width": 104, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "elbowed": true, "groupIds": [], "seed": 3501, "points": [[0, 0], [104, 0]], "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "c1-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "c2-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "boundElements": [{"id": "ar-c1c2-t", "type": "text"}], "index": "a250"},
    {"id": "ar-c1c2-t", "type": "text", "x": 380, "y": 2336, "width": 80, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": [], "seed": 3502, "text": "Pay", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "ar-c1c2", "index": "a251"},
    {"id": "ar-c2c3", "type": "arrow", "x": 788, "y": 2350, "width": 104, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "elbowed": true, "groupIds": [], "seed": 3503, "points": [[0, 0], [104, 0]], "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "c2-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "c3-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "boundElements": [{"id": "ar-c2c3-t", "type": "text"}], "index": "a252"},
    {"id": "ar-c2c3-t", "type": "text", "x": 800, "y": 2336, "width": 80, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": [], "seed": 3504, "text": "it lands", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "ar-c2c3", "index": "a253"},

    {"id": "ar-a4c1", "type": "arrow", "x": 1628, "y": 640, "width": -1576, "height": 1710, "strokeColor": "#0053d0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "elbowed": true, "groupIds": ["handoff-out"], "seed": 3601, "points": [[0, 0], [52, 0], [52, 380], [-1588, 380], [-1588, 1710], [-1576, 1710]], "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "a4-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "c1-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "index": "a260"},
    {"id": "ar-a4c1-t", "type": "text", "x": 700, "y": 1000, "width": 400, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#0053d0", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["handoff-out"], "seed": 3602, "text": "the app opens the browser on the invoice it reserved", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a261"},
    {"id": "ar-c3a5", "type": "arrow", "x": 1208, "y": 2350, "width": 1292, "height": -1710, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "elbowed": true, "groupIds": ["handoff-back"], "seed": 3603, "points": [[0, 0], [1292, 0], [1292, -1330], [902, -1330], [902, -1710], [840, -1710]], "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startBinding": {"elementId": "c3-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "endBinding": {"elementId": "a5-panel", "focus": 0, "gap": 8}, "index": "a262"},
    {"id": "ar-c3a5-t", "type": "text", "x": 1300, "y": 2324, "width": 420, "height": 13, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["handoff-back"], "seed": 3604, "text": "simplex: brings the app forward - it is never the proof of payment", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a263"},

    {"id": "ft-head", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2830, "width": 800, "height": 22, "strokeColor": "#1c1e26", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["footer"], "seed": 4001, "text": "What this needs that does not exist yet", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a300"},
    {"id": "ft-svc", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 2870, "width": 760, "height": 105, "strokeColor": "#4b5563", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["footer"], "seed": 4002, "text": "The service, which today answers only redeemBadgeCode and issueBadge\n\n   getBadgeCatalog, whose first client would be the app\n   getBadgeInvoice, bound to a purchase key instead of a code hash, and\n      reserving the amount before a method is chosen - the page picks that\n   purchaseBadge funded by an invoice, answering payment_pending until the\n      webhook settles\n   Apple and Google receipt verification, for which no provider adapter exists", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a301"},
    {"id": "ft-app", "type": "text", "x": 900, "y": 2870, "width": 760, "height": 105, "strokeColor": "#4b5563", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["footer"], "seed": 4003, "text": "The app, which has the store layer already and no purchase API\n\n   APIGetBadgeCatalog, APIGetBadgeInvoice, APIPurchaseBadge\n   A4 and A5 as views, and the pending purchase behind A5 on BadgeState,\n      kept in the invoices and payments tables the client schema already carries\n   the badge worker polling it, and the pitch banner suppressed while it runs\n   finishing a store transaction only once the credential is stored, so that\n      Transaction.updates and queryPurchasesAsync redeliver it until it lands", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a302"},
    {"id": "ft-web", "type": "text", "x": 1740, "y": 2870, "width": 740, "height": 105, "strokeColor": "#4b5563", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["footer"], "seed": 4004, "text": "The page, which needs the least\n\n   C3: a paid state for an invoice it did not create, and a link back to the app\n   an order started from a purchase key rather than a code hash\n   nothing else - it already chooses the method and takes the payment", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a303"},
    {"id": "ft-note", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 3000, "width": 2400, "height": 26, "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "roughness": 0, "groupIds": ["footer"], "seed": 4005, "text": "Copy is quoted from the app and the page, so what reads wrong here reads wrong there too - except C3's 'Still processing', reworded off the page's 'This takes a block'. Non-store prices are the shipped catalog; store prices are illustrative.\nNot drawn yet: the refusals - no active price, a provider unavailable, too many attempts, and the catalog moving under the buyer - each of which the page already has a screen for.", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "autoResize": true, "index": "a304"}
  ]
}
